This is a fork of hap (https://github.com/brutella/hap) by Matthias
Hochgatterer, a Go implementation of the HomeKit Accessory Protocol, forked at
v0.0.35 (bc03ca6) and maintained by homectl.ai for homectl (https://homectl.ai).
All of the protocol work is theirs; see the upstream history in this repository.

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE), as the original is.

Changes since the fork:
- Module path github.com/homectl-ai/hctl-hap (package name still hap).
- pairings: Identifier is optional, so iOS's ListPairings request is accepted
  instead of failing with "tlv8: EOF" (brutella/hap#67).
- server_test: TestConfigHash builds a fresh accessory for its second server
  (it failed at v0.0.35 since NewServer stopped overriding assigned ids).
